---
// Ücretsiz İşitme Testi — /degerlendirme/ucretsiz-isitme-testi. First
// page of the "Değerlendirme" series (see header.data.ts's servicesMega
// first column) — a new content genre within the site: a clinical
// SERVICE page rather than a product, trust, or tier page. Built on the
// same master templates and shared, data-driven Brand Component
// Architecture used throughout the session (same KulakArkasiComparison
// component, already generic, reused as-is), but this series returns to
// the full health-content safety discipline used in the İhtiyacınıza
// Göre series (self-diagnosis disclaimers, urgent-care flags, hedged
// language), since this page's subject is a diagnostic procedure, not a
// product category.
//
// Scope note: this page covers the overall free-test service and
// appointment experience; the more specific technical procedures
// (Odyometri, Timpanometri, Çocuk İşitme Testi, Tinnitus Değerlendirme)
// get their own future pages in this series — this page's own Ecosystem
// section previews and cross-references each rather than re-explaining
// them in full.
//
// accentColor: camgöbeği / cyan-600 (#0891b2) — opens a fresh accent
// rotation for the servicesMega "Değerlendirme" column; see hero.ts for
// the full rationale.
//
// 14-section flow, in order: Hero -> Nedir? + Nasıl İşler? -> Kimler
// İşitme Testi Yaptırmalı? -> Avantajları -> Dikkat Edilmesi Gerekenler
// -> Test Süreci -> Testte Neler Değerlendirilir -> Teknolojiler ->
// Markalara Göre İnceleyin -> Klinik vs Online Test -> Uzman Yorumu ->
// SSS -> Premium CTA -> İlgili İçerikler.
